PARSFILE
#FullDataName Models: Simulink`Driver Model - 2 SFs`Steering and Steering Controls
#RunMdlFile Extensions\Simulink\Driver_2SF.slx
SIMULINK_MODEL_FILE Extensions\Simulink\Driver_2SF.slx
#RingCtrl0 -1
#RingCtrl2 2
OPT_MULTI_WRAPPERS 1
*MULTI_S_WRAPPER 1
*MULTI_SOLVERS 0
#CheckBox0 0    
*USE_ALT_DIR 0
#CheckBox1 0    
*USE_DIFF_SOLVERS 0
#CheckBox3 1    
#CheckBox5 0    
#RingCtrl1 0
OPT_INT_METHOD 0
*TSTEP 0.0005
*FREQ_MODEL 2000
*TSTEP_OUT 0.025
*FREQ_OUT 40
tstep 0.0005
iprint 50
#BlueLink0 I/O Channels: Import`Steering Wheel Angle` Steering System Control` , Import`Import_e162b7ef-9515-4d6b-861a-eaf869a81e05

#BlueLink1 I/O Channels: Export`Ext. Driver Model w/ Driver Preview Pts.` Steering System Control` , Import/Export`Export_4deac4b6-9935-4055-9378-ac47c99557d4

IWRAPPER 1
PARSFILE IO_Channels\Ports\Port_ca930599-395a-4c6d-8016-ef2357d6af5d.par
#BlueLink3 I/O Channels: Ports`Exported Path Preview` External Driver Model` , vs_state Ports`Port_ca930599-395a-4c6d-8016-ef2357d6af5d

IWRAPPER 2
PARSFILE IO_Channels\Ports\Port_b96d0a85-796d-4dce-a490-bfa4ffb37b49.par
#BlueLink4 I/O Channels: Ports`Imported Steering Wheel Angle` External Driver Model` , vs_ctl Ports`Port_b96d0a85-796d-4dce-a490-bfa4ffb37b49

IWRAPPER 3
#BlueLink5 I/O Channels: Ports` ` , vs_dyn Ports` , vs_kin Ports`

IWRAPPER 4
#BlueLink6 I/O Channels: Ports` ` , vs_dyn Ports` , vs_dyn Ports`

LIVE_SERVER_UPDATE_FREQ_MAX 60

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This dataset links to a Simulink model of a steering controller that replaces the steering wheel angle determined by the built-in CarSim model.
#
#It uses 2 CarSim S-Functions: one to export variables related to the sate of the vehicle and path preview, and the other to import a Steering wheel angle from Simulink
#
